{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1508312-five-questions-for-scion-and-the-world","id":1508312,"title":"Five Questions for Scion and the World","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-13T18:29:35-07:00","id":1508312,"title":"Five Questions for Scion and the World","content":"I'm thinking of adding &quot;Five Questions&quot; to Scion. Not to create a morality system (gods no), but to help embed the characters into the World and its innate weirdness. The problem is... I got next to nothing. So here I am, falling on my sword and asking for help...<br /> <br /> But I do not come empty handed.<br /> <br /> Here's what I have so far: Though I only really like numbers 4 and 5<br /> <br /> 1. What's the most Miraculous thing you've ever seen (Good or bad)?<br /> 2. What's the most Miraculous thing that's ever happened to you or someone you love?<br /> 3. What's the most Miraculous thing that you've ever heard of?<br /> 4. What is something you've ignored?<br /> 5. What don't you believe?<br /> <br /> I feel like I'm onto something... I just don't like the current iteration.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts?<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance,<br /> Ray","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-14T16:32:07-07:00","id":1508401,"title":"","content":"I feel like for your players to respond, you'd need to sketch out how miraculous your world is. Is magic something everyone knows is real but rarely sees? Or do centaurs gallop down major city streets?<br /> <br /> Beyond that, maybe questions that tie them to specific aspects of the world. What Pantheon other than your own do you have a connection with, whether good or bad? Where do you go most frequently to make contact with your own Pantheon--a temple, park, occult bookstore, etc.?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26114-muskrat","name":"Muskrat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-21T11:27:25-07:00","id":1509218,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the input and you're right!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}